{"tier":"glm-5.2","verse":43,"ref":"numbers 31:43","book":"numbers","lang":"om","chapter":31,"translation":"Bakki wal-qixa taate kan garee ti, ⟨dhiifama⟩ hiriyyaa keessaa: saddeet-saddeet-mootummaa fi... Hiika sirrii: Gitu gareen tokko, ⟨kan⟩ loltootaa miti, hiriyyaa keessaa — sadii dhibba kumaa fi sadii-kurnyee kumaa, torba kumaa fi shan dhibba.","tokens":[{"surface":"ותהי","gloss":"taate"},{"surface":"מחצת","gloss":"gitu tokko"},{"surface":"העדה","gloss":"kan garee"},{"surface":"מן","gloss":"keessaa"},{"surface":"הצאן","gloss":"hiriyyaa"},{"surface":"שלש","gloss":"sadii"},{"surface":"מאות","gloss":"dhibba"},{"surface":"אלף","gloss":"kumaa"},{"surface":"ושלשים","gloss":"fi sadii-kurnyee"},{"surface":"אלף","gloss":"kumaa"},{"surface":"שבעת","gloss":"torba"},{"surface":"אלפים","gloss":"kumaa"},{"surface":"וחמש","gloss":"fi shan"},{"surface":"מאות","gloss":"dhibba"}],"timestamp":"2026-08-29T15:56:28.256785478Z","model":"glm-5.3"}